      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1) The court may, in an application in which a protection order is sought, in addition to issuing a protection order, make an order that one or more of the parties to the dispute be referred to a rehabilitation programme, provided that an order to refer the victim to a rehabilitation programme shall be made only with the consent of the victim.”;"
